  "Type /move to open or close the window. Type /move FrameName to move a frame by its name. Type /move pick to pick a frame on the screen. Type /move hide FrameName to hide or show a frame. Type /move done to stop moving all frames. Type /unmove FrameName to put a frame back where the game puts it. Type /move key <key> to set a key for the window. Type /movelist to see the saved layouts, /movecopy Name to copy one and /movedelete Name to delete one.": "Команди: /move (вікно), /move FrameName (перемістити), /move pick (вибрати), /move hide FrameName (приховати/показати), /move done (готово), /unmove FrameName (скинути), /move key <key> (клавіша), /movelist (список), /movecopy Name (копіювати), /movedelete Name (видалити).",
